        <briefdescription>
<para>Get the status of delays (Memory helper: number of delays passed.) </para>        </briefdescription>
        <detaileddescription>
<para><parameterlist kind="param"><parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
<parametername>data</parametername>
</parameternamelist>
