</parameteritem>
</parameterlist>
<simplesect kind="return"><para>-1 if cancelled (fin_ms = 0), 0 if none of the delays are passed, 1 if only the intermediate delay is passed, 2 if the final delay is passed. </para></simplesect>
</para>        </detaileddescription>
